{"unit_id":"topmindspace__dsh-super-kanban#card-zh","repo":"topmindspace/dsh-super-kanban","commit":"669b276f8370bc92d61726818bbd541c0c93c42f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Super Kanban 是面向 DSH Web 界面的任务看板插件：它把工作区会话转换为可持续更新的任务卡，并在主面板和会话右侧栏提供入口。插件扫描本机会话日志，用规则或可选的 DeepSeek 分析提取目标、进度、问题和证据；还可维护子任务、归档任务并从任务生成续接提示。适合同时处理多个 DSH 会话、希望集中查看进展并手动修订任务的人。联网分析需要 DSH 中可用的 DeepSeek 账号；关闭后仍可使用本地规则分析。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:21-48","client.js:3591-3636","server/service.mjs:988-1059","server/analyzer-llm.mjs:16-18"]}
{"unit_id":"topmindspace__dsh-super-kanban#card-en","repo":"topmindspace/dsh-super-kanban","commit":"669b276f8370bc92d61726818bbd541c0c93c42f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Super Kanban turns DSH sessions into task cards in a panel or sidebar. It scans local logs and uses rules or optional DeepSeek analysis to summarize goals, progress, and issues. Users can manage subtasks and create handoff prompts. Online analysis uses a DSH DeepSeek account; rules work offline.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:21-48","client.js:3591-3636","server/service.mjs:988-1059","server/analyzer-llm.mjs:16-18"]}
