{"unit_id":"topmindspace__dsh-super-kanban#feature-1","repo":"topmindspace/dsh-super-kanban","commit":"669b276f8370bc92d61726818bbd541c0c93c42f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Super Kanban 的功能「从会话生成任务卡」：扫描 DSH 工作区会话并整理目标、状态、进度、问题与证据；规则分析始终可用，也可选择联网分析。自动扫描或手动扫描后更新看板。","source":"generated","evidence":["server/service.mjs:988-1059","server/analyzer-rules.mjs:375-390"]}
{"unit_id":"topmindspace__dsh-super-kanban#feature-2","repo":"topmindspace/dsh-super-kanban","commit":"669b276f8370bc92d61726818bbd541c0c93c42f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Super Kanban 的功能「双入口任务看板」：在 DSH 主面板或会话右侧栏打开任务板，查看任务状态、筛选和详情，并手动新建、编辑、归档或删除任务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:3591-3636","client.js:3580-3589"]}
{"unit_id":"topmindspace__dsh-super-kanban#feature-3","repo":"topmindspace/dsh-super-kanban","commit":"669b276f8370bc92d61726818bbd541c0c93c42f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Super Kanban 的功能「任务续接与子任务」：从任务详情生成包含目标、关键事实和待解决问题的结构化提示，可放入原会话或同工作区新会话；子任务也可单独维护。","source":"generated","evidence":["server/service.mjs:1954-1975","client.js:168-180"]}
{"unit_id":"topmindspace__dsh-super-kanban#caveat-1","repo":"topmindspace/dsh-super-kanban","commit":"669b276f8370bc92d61726818bbd541c0c93c42f","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Super Kanban 可将压缩后的会话摘要发送到 api.deepseek.com 进行可选分析；关闭 AI 后仍使用本地规则分析。（见 server/analyzer-llm.mjs:16,223-231）","source":"generated","evidence":["server/analyzer-llm.mjs:16","server/analyzer-llm.mjs:223-231"]}
